I built the notebook around the exact CSE440 project requirements from your PDF: extensive EDA, three preprocessing versions, TF-IDF with one ML model and one deep neural network, skip-gram with all required recurrent models, and reporting with accuracy, macro F1, confusion matrix, and classification report. I also kept explanations in markdown cells rather than inline code comments, which matches the notebook instructions in the PDF. 

